PATIENT EDUCATION

Treatment Explanation: Because your blood sugar is running slightly high, your body is trying to flush it out through your urine at night, making you exhausted. This extra sugar also feeds the yeast on your skin, causing the painful rash. The prescribed cream will kill the yeast and reduce the inflammation.
Actionable Steps: Attend the pathology clinic strictly fasting (nothing to eat or drink except water from midnight) tomorrow morning. Stop drinking all sugary sodas and juices immediately. Apply the cream twice a day.

